  "summary": "hcom is a single-binary Rust CLI that lets coding agents message, observe, spawn, and fork each other via hooks and a local SQLite database, with an MQTT-based relay for cross-device sync. Evidence covers the README product docs and the relay command implementation; one prior claim about a Rust 1.88+ build requirement was dropped as unsupported. Evidence coverage: 166 of 230 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
